}}_{S}x.$   \n\nComputing the cosine using the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{x\\cdot {\\text{proj}}_{S}x}{‖x‖‖{\\text{proj}}_{S}x‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 2}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{\\sqrt{14}\\sqrt{12}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{2\\sqrt{42}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{42}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{42}})≈{22.21}^{∘},\n$$\n\nwhich is already an acute angle." 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369331 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369332 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369333 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369334 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369335 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1041 "selection" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1104 #edb/ref 17592186369331 13194139535838 true] [17592186369330 1110 #uuid "935ea930-c8d1-59e3-8b84-8bf4ae88a3be" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369331 1034 "{22.21}^{∘}" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369331 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535838 true] [17592186369331 1111 #uuid "3a912902-59f7-5bf5-a2bc-fa66cc2f3b81" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369332 1034 "{14.21}^{∘}" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369332 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535838 true] [17592186369332 1111 #uuid "1e3756c7-f8fd-554a-b52f-7422bacedc3b" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369333 1034 "{54.05}^{∘}" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369333 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535838 true] [17592186369333 1111 #uuid "c4090e9f-99a9-520d-9bc6-613091d28576" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369334 1034 "{45.12}^{∘}" 13194139535838 true] [17592186369334 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535838 true] [17592186369334 1111 #uuid "c3706f4b-0c2f-5499-8301-b6a65cd68